    "body":  "Refs #28. Post-merge governance backfill for SR-003 after implementation PR #34 was merged into `docs/restore-original-designs-20261125` at `32c7c1be5e93bddc83349234476b2ffa09e1ca23` (not `main`).\n\n### Scope and final document versions\n- SR-003 **v0.3.10** — status IMPLEMENTED; explicit PR #31 / Issue #30 superseded outcome.\n- SR-003 implementation record **v0.2.5** — final CI Head and merged baseline, no stale \"awaiting tests/merge\" wording.\n- Acceptance baseline **v0.3.16** — AC-003-01～04 preserved; imported Echo peer and superseded #31 correctly reflected.\n- SR total index **v0.3.30**; implementation overview **v0.3.32**; feature tree **v0.6.21**.\n- Cross-repo audit **v0.4.35** — historical 26-SR snapshots explicitly distinguished from the 27-SR current state.\n- Document index **v0.4.31** — latest audit link aligned.\n\n### Final state and evidence\n- Current SR state: **3 VERIFIED / 2 IMPLEMENTED / 22 DRAFT**, total 27; SR-003 is **IMPLEMENTED, not VERIFIED**.\n- Implementation PR #34: final tested head `e8bcb1b89de5094a4b1b68f973af6720801c7fbd`, same tree as merged commit. [CI #45815167442](https://github.com/odango-chan/ca-agent-next/actions/runs/45815167442) SUCCESS (Linux Python 3.12 and Windows Python 3.14, each Plugin 87 / Host 52 / Review Context 80 tests PASS).\n- PR #31\u0027s 5-document alignment (IPC v0.2.5, AC-003 registry, governance traceability) is already integrated by #34: [PR #31](https://github.com/odango-chan/ca-agent-next/pull/31) closed as **superseded, not merged**; [Issue #30](https://github.com/odango-chan/ca-agent-next/issues/30) closed as completed.\n- This PR changes **only eight Markdown documents**; no runtime code or tests.\n- Revision versions/last revision-row coverage and fence parity checked across all 8 docs; stale current-state statements targeted in this review are cleared. Pre-existing historical tree documentation defects are outside scope.\n- System EX-02/03/04/18, Provider v2 wire DTO / SR-010, full Runtime E2E and formal repository-wide documentation gate remain NOT_RUN. No upgrade to VERIFIED.\n",
